installer-mnemonic-recovery-help
=> "If you were using a hot key (a key stored on the computer) in your wallet, you will need to recover it from its seed phrase to be able to sign transactions again. Otherwise you can directly go the next step."
=> "Wenn du in deinem Wallet einen Softwareschlüssel (einen auf dem Computer gespeicherten Schlüssel) verwendet hast, musst du ihn aus seiner Seed-Phrase wiederherstellen, um wieder Transaktionen signieren zu können. Andernfalls kannst du direkt mit dem nächsten Schritt fortfahren.";;

installer-multisig-description-1
=> "For this setup you will need 3 keys: two primary keys and a recovery key. For security reasons, we suggest you use a separate signing device, commonly known as a hardware wallet, for each key."
