installer-register-descriptor-help
=> "To be used with the wallet, a signing device needs the descriptor. If the descriptor contains one or more keys imported from an external signing device, the descriptor must be registered on it. Registration confirms that the device is able to handle the policy. Registration on a device is not a substitute for backing up the descriptor."
